              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.204,
                0.451,
                0.219
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 核苷酸的呋喃型核糖是六元环结构。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.223,
                0.417,
                0.238
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 腺嘌呤的 2 位有一个取代氨基。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.241,
                0.643,
                0.256
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 在 RNA 的生物合成过程中，GTP 的 a 磷原子渗入 RNA 链中。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.26,
                0.363,
                0.274
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 逆转录酶具有校对功能。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.278,
                0.433,
                0.293
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 内含子的剪切反应都不需要 ATP。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.297,
                0.547,
                0.312
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 真核细胞 DNA 的高度重复顺序也称“卫星 DNA”。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.315,
                0.469,
                0.33
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 限制图和遗传图的制作方法是一样的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.334,
                0.399,
                0.348
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 色氨酸操纵子有负调节机制。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.352,
                0.451,
                0.367
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9. 以质粒为载体的转基因过程称转导。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.371,
            0.514,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 真核生物一个基因可产生多种蛋白质产物。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.389,
            0.786,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. 葡萄糖-6-磷酸进入酵解或磷酸戊糖途径主要取决于NADP+和NADPH的比值。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.408,
            0.585,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12. 发酵和酵解均不需氧参加，故统称为糖的无氧分解。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.427,
            0.338,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": [
